Lab 18: Creating Custom Content Collections
Objectives

By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

• Understand the structure and purpose of Ansible content collections • Create a custom content collection containing roles and playbooks • Package and build your custom collection • Share collections with other teams using Ansible Galaxy • Implement best practices for collection development and distribution
