## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues and Solutions

**Issue**: Collection build fails with "galaxy.yml not found"
**Solution**: Ensure you're in the collection root directory containing galaxy.yml

**Issue**: Role tasks fail with "module not found"
**Solution**: Verify all required modules are available and collection dependencies are installed

**Issue**: Permission denied when installing packages
**Solution**: Ensure the ansible user has sudo privileges and become: yes is set

**Issue**: Service fails to start
**Solution**: Check firewall settings and SELinux policies on target systems

